{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1000_p", "source_sha256": "324ab9dd8331226760aa9453a84f06e587b785f8803127eea8ee6969140fd9e1", "ja": "静香、お疲れさま。新しい衣装だけど……\nあれ、静香？　いないのか……？", "zh": "静香，辛苦了。关于新服装……\n咦，静香？不在吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "931a90370193b1a29007d47ee320e9a425606397120eba26d2715b8d963c3979", "ja": "……かかりましたね、{$P$}。\n背後、取らせていただきました。", "zh": "……上钩了呢，{$P$}。\n您的背后，我就收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2c01ad32f46cb5741954d26f42643ae8ab1c956638f295fb51dd041205bf0ff6", "ja": "うおっ！？　い、いつの間に後ろに……\nまさかずっと、物陰に隠れていたのか？", "zh": "哇啊！？什、什么时候跑到背后的……\n难道你一直都躲在暗处吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "9119f94e67e12b4a8be6d935aecc392fa4a6139defc8707564d22adaa5931212", "ja": "はい。忍びらしく、忍んでいました。\nどうでしたか、私の忍術。", "zh": "是的。作为忍者，我一直在悄悄隐藏。\n怎么样，我的忍术？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0e584c530975b0ee411f5c61d635a5440a935ae2feba3c35d161972ed6788d30", "ja": "いやもう、本当にビックリしたよ……\n情けない声も上げちゃったし。", "zh": "哎呀，真的吓了我一大跳啊……\n而且我还叫出了那么丢脸的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5a97663696b0358909c4ecd9cb42f99eed38fc7fcb9c6a729bc987e53d2d178", "ja": "全く気付いてなかったんですね。あのリアクション、\n今の私にとっては、最大の褒め言葉です。", "zh": "你真的完全没察觉到呢。刚才那个反应，对现在的我来说就是最高的赞美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c3e7bdf788684c8c7dcb8d5f15ceaaf83f30349e64313084913bbe8a58a0bde6", "ja": "はは、そうか。静香が満足してくれたなら、\n恥ずかしい思いをした甲斐もあったかな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。既然静香满意，那我这次丢脸也算值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3312b417bccd59d33ecf7b7175e9be62ad84994dc32f8a9aea85254443231a04", "ja": "何より、新しい衣装を気に入ってくれたみたいで\n嬉しいよ。", "zh": "最重要的是，她似乎很喜欢新服装，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "47c66f1b1e9aa8496470802e0cd8880e60086d9e87cd776528a7ae9448214ed7", "ja": "え……どうして気に入ったってわかったんですか？\n感想、まだ何も言ってないですよね？", "zh": "咦……您是怎么知道我喜欢这套衣服的？\n我还什么都没说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0b44414f55137fae88e5e11f7867bf2b57004b0fb51e98a44e31cee711b8d786", "ja": "言わなくてもわかるよ。\n忍者になりきって、俺をからかうくらいだし……。", "zh": "不用说我也看得出来。你都已经入戏当忍者来戏弄我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "d35d44c8b21368ae0be0115b604581de626a49635af3afde0e31c152a507e326", "ja": "か、からかってません！　今のはその、\n忍びらしく振舞おうと思っただけです！", "zh": "才、才没有捉弄你！刚才只是，想着要表现得像个忍者而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "274a4f61010525cf6502fe6d05fd0eaa2c01cb70f8768f79b2c729e93754654b", "ja": "イメージトレーニングというか……\nとにかく、浮かれてたわけじゃないですから！", "zh": "算是想象训练吧……\n总之，我才没有得意忘形！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f385725d9856114a073565106bf190a28f7cf548630e18787607e0dbd258bfc4", "ja": "うん、別に浮かれてるとは思ってないよ。\nただ喜んでくれたんだなぁと思って。", "zh": "嗯，我没觉得你是在得意忘形。\n只是觉得你是真的很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "002db91fc343b46c01df54cabe103a239f10a32b626b86fcbea56d0b0d81790a", "ja": "絶対わかってないですよね……はぁ。今回は\n衣装に合わせて、クールでいようと思ったのに。", "zh": "你根本就没明白吧……唉。这次我本来想配合服装，保持冷酷一点的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5aea95e035c8824dbd95c143c58f46e49daa461b1023e86b862ff5895e0b8402", "ja": "いや、想像以上にクールでカッコいいよ。\n本物のくノ一にしか見えないし。", "zh": "没有，比我想象的还要帅气又冷艳哦。\n看起来完全就是货真价子女忍者的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a1550985c2c9b6c6b6c22b2f721a3e6198b58a55ae0b137e93583c54939105a7", "ja": "静香はそういう、凛とした衣装が様になるな。\nすごく似合ってる！", "zh": "静香很适合这种凛然的服装。非常适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "d2cf946f333ce62444e626d8740d686355efd5d4112432c67ca428519cca06c1", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？　ありがとうございま……\nって、もう！", "zh": "真、真的吗？谢谢您……\n真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "aaff96c118b2dc8c1da79fee16c97a21bac2b1b308268dac647ca618d19a5449", "ja": "せっかく切り替えたのに、{$P$}が\n褒めるから、また崩れちゃったじゃないですか！", "zh": "好不容易才调整好状态，结果因为{$P$}夸我，又崩掉了不是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dfd25821b376d08c9bbb884dba47e8e14bca962d15c3266fcc4821cf284e7241", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nなら、もう褒めない方がいいか？", "zh": "这、这样啊。那我还是别再夸你比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "6db272ab30a257dffdf058904bd20a0331abacf2e9fa9b3ec0cb04b450bea612", "ja": "あ……いえ。感想をいただけないのも……そうですね、\n代わりに、もう一度リアクションをもらえますか？", "zh": "啊……不是。要是连感想都得不到……嗯，这样吧，能再给我一次反应吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "8ceb2381d3621b1c8f47d79910949061cc503c2c42690a24164064684936f4be", "ja": "私が忍びらしく振る舞いますから、いい反応を\nお願いしますね。{$P$}。", "zh": "我会表现得像个忍者，请您好好配合反应哦。{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e05a23dde111e93f3903d2ee9e652ebe1105815f83629d5020390628207dd898", "ja": "リアクションか……わかった。\n頑張ってみるよ。", "zh": "反应吗……知道了。\n我会努力试试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0484_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b66b433a59fcdc63e880d153ad56cff6b2370220369b4a55670bc94e3eaa330b", "ja": "（静香の中の何かに火をつけてしまったようだ……。\n次は一体、どんな忍術を見せられるんだろう？）", "zh": "（好像点燃了静香心中的某种东西……。接下来到底会让我们看到什么样的忍术呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
